# .Renviron configuration for sandbox-sync
# Place this file in the root of your r_script_sandbox folder.
# This is the ONLY place the sandbox paths are recorded: the Positron
# extension reads it directly, and the block in ~/.Rprofile loads it into R.

# REQUIRED: absolute path to your data sandbox (on a cloud drive).
# Use forward slashes, also on Windows. Quote the value if it has spaces.
DATA_PATH="/path/to/data_sandbox"

# OPTIONAL: absolute path to your scripts sandbox. Leave it out: it defaults
# to the folder this file is in.
# SCRIPT_PATH="/path/to/r_script_sandbox"
